{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to your first day as a Guild Receptionist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the hero slaying dragons, you just decide who's foolish enough to try! While the guild's reputation is in shambles, every quest you approve could rebuild its glory... or bury it further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Quest, Please</strong></i> is a medieval fantasy job simulator where your observational skills and keen memory will be put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes of All Shapes and Sizes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/7d39fac8b77ffff5b822242bc967fe46.poster.avif?t=1755716922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/7d39fac8b77ffff5b822242bc967fe46.webm?t=1755716922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/7d39fac8b77ffff5b822242bc967fe46.mp4?t=1755716922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of adventurers with their own quirks, ambitions, and questionable sense of preparedness. Some will come asking to slay monsters, others to hunt treasure, and a few will bring the strangest requests you\u2019ve never heard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Approve and Reject Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/a58e901a37dc436520e39cc2563e1bfc.poster.avif?t=1755716922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/a58e901a37dc436520e39cc2563e1bfc.webm?t=1755716922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/a58e901a37dc436520e39cc2563e1bfc.mp4?t=1755716922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to determine if an adventurer is capable of completing a quest based on their stats, skills, and personality. Every quest demands something different, and the things to look out for grows everyday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone wants you to do a good job. Some will try to bribe, charm, or even threaten their way past you. Will you play it safe and just do your job, or will you gamble with the guild\u2019s future and live with the consequences?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955230?t=1755716922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955230?t=1755716922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/c0510cfec7b54c45b7465e3588030f0849e055d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755716922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/c0510cfec7b54c45b7465e3588030f0849e055d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755716922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to your first day as a Guild Receptionist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the hero slaying dragons, you just decide who's foolish enough to try! While the guild'