s to determine if an adventurer is capable of completing a quest based on their stats, skills, and personality. Every quest demands something different, and the things to look out for grows everyday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone wants you to do a good job. Some will try to bribe, charm, or even threaten their way past you. Will you play it safe and just do your job, or will you gamble with the guild\u2019s future and live with the consequences?</p>","developers":["Drix Dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/2181a926c8a9e05f1ad754c08b72b0644ac7989e/header.jpg?t=1755716922","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184348,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184348/movie480.mp4?t=1755716921","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184348/movie_max.mp4?t=1755716921"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184348/e18429a27435513538c006c5f6e0ab085e7453f8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755716921","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184348/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755716921","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184348/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755716921"}}],"name":"Quest, Please","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit versions 